    "searchText": "salvager needed (lrg. supply of rmc / ucm / components) salvager needed (lrg. special order of rmc / ucm / components) adagio_rg_shipsalvage_nyx_rank2_rmc_cmats_components_unique adagio holdings salvage standing pickup: nyx, stanton, pyro adagio holdings\na proud equal opportunity employer\n\n> about the job tractor beam.  \n\nwe recommend searching for wreckage at lagrange points, maybe in one of nyx's asteroid belts, or you could purchase a salvage claim from us in your contract manager. we advise extra caution since there have been vanduul sightings in the system, especially with how long it might take for you to track down this specific order.  \n\nonce acquired, deliver the materials to the freight elevator located at [destination].\n\nfor advice on salvaging, consult a salvager's guide to material collection in your mobiglas journal.\n\n> requirements  disclaimer <\ncontractors are responsible for ensuring that they are collecting materials from vehicles that are considered fair salvage under the pursuant uee laws. adagio holdings is in no way liable for any crimes or misdemeanors committed by contractors and will offer no compensation or reparation for any persons affected by these actions. 09f5d6ae-c1a2-4dba-ba0d-886c33ea1af6 993fbe39-f45a-456a-a94a-a65714c1db49 c2bf4edf-eb40-4abb-a81d-03bac07badd8 1331671c-4bbd-47bc-b71e-c19def138faa 3b19ec12-1267-4cc7-be0e-7c0c5273fb81 7858db48-7eb6-4a6c-b56b-5df1c5235d1d acf17ba4-4007-466c-9081-72aee28232b3 blueprint: adagio resource gathering ship salvage: trawler scraper module, abrade scraper module, comer scraper module, hart scraper module +1 standing +150 393,750 auec 584,500 auec 569,250 auec 396,500 auec 979,750 auec 418,000 auec"
